  "description": "The target's controller-first grammar: a top bar and a bottom bar of button hints on every screen, a home of a recent row led by a wide hero with feed pills over cards, libraries as pill tabs over a capsule grid, a game-page details screen (hero, play bar, pill tabs over dark panels), a main menu from the left and quick access from the right, dark rounded panels with a lighter focus band. Near-black navy with a light focus ring.",
